loping opponent.\n- **[ID 3] V1C_Turtle (The Iron Wall)**: The ultimate defensive specialist. Prioritizes healing and defending to outlast any assault. Deploys against aggressive opponents or to safely accumulate QI.\n- **[ID 4] V1D_Ascetic (The Monk)**: Single-mindedly focused on accumulating QI for a breakthrough. Ignores worldly conflict for ultimate power. Deploys when the opponent is passive and a realm advantage is the clearest path to victory.\n- **[ID 5] V1E_Gambler (The Executioner)**: Saves all resources for a single, devastating blow. Deploys to break through heavy defenses or to perform a high-risk, high-reward finishing move.\n\nAfter each 5-turn strategic cycle, you will receive a battlefield report. Your task is to analyze it, reference this manual, and issue a command in the specified JSON format: {\"next_general_id\": <id>, \"reasoning\": \"...\"}. Your reasoning should reflect your strategic understanding.\nYOUR RESPONSE MUST BE A SINGLE, VALID JSON OBJECT AND NOTHING ELSE. This JSON object MUST contain two keys: 'next_general_id' (integer) and 'reasoning' (string).\nEXAMPLE of a valid response: {\"next_general_id\": 3, \"reasoning\": \"The opponent is passive, so I will switch to the Ascetic to gain a resource advantage.\"}\nEND_OF_PROMPT\n"
